# Held by docs/crypto/check.py (docs/CRYPTO-LEARN.md §7). The count of
# [[not_crypto]] entries in docs/crypto/actions.toml: a function the
# inventory's rules find that computes nothing on a secret or signed data.
# It only falls; raising it is the owner's decision, recorded in DECISIONS.
not_crypto 6
# The count of `[[action.screens_not]]` entries: a screen whose code calls an
# action's root and does not offer the action (docs/CRYPTO-LEARN.md §9.2). It only
# falls; raising it is the owner's decision, recorded in DECISIONS (F164).
screens_not 24
